0..76 Comment "//! `circuit-feed-wheel` models a guarded feedback rule in a `theory` block."
77..80 Comment "//!"
81..144 Comment "//! `spin` feeds `out` back as `state` after one observed tick."
145..219 Comment "//! The pathological source refuses unguarded feedback. The running source"
220..267 Comment "//! refuses a model that states a circuit rule."
268..271 Comment "//!"
272..337 Comment "//! The checker reads `state` under the `emit` observation, which"
338..358 Comment "//! guards the loop."
359..362 Comment "//!"
